      "title": "",
      "text": "%hive\nCREATE EXTERNAL TABLE IF NOT EXISTS log4jLogs (\n   t1 string, t2 string, t3 string, t4 string, \n   t5 string, t6 string, t7 string\n)\nROW FORMAT DELIMITED\nFIELDS TERMINATED BY ' '\nSTORED AS TEXTFILE;\n\nLOAD DATA INPATH '/user/data/log4jLogs.txt' INTO TABLE log4jLogs;\n",
