      "title": "",
      "text": "%spark.pyspark\n# Liste des tables dans toutes les databases :\ndatabases = spark.sql(\"SHOW DATABASES\").collect()\nfor db in databases:\n    db_name = db[0]\n    print(f\"Tables in database '{db_name}':\")\n    spark.sql(f\"SHOW TABLES IN {db_name}\").show()\n",
